      "description": "All seven endpoints under `/api/v1/auth`. Protected routes (`/me`, `/change-password`, `/logout`) are gated by `checkAuth(ADMIN, DOCTOR, PATIENT, SUPER_ADMIN)` — every role passes, so the gate is really just \"authenticated\"."
